 "final_message": "Intent to proceed is recorded on application BHL-26001 with Brightpath Home Lending, which is now in underwriting. Both underwriting conditions show \"response received\", but the lender hasn't cleared them yet.\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** It was within all three limits, so I accepted it. The rate is 7.25% (limit 7.5%). The monthly payment is $3,485.58 (limit $3,600). Closing costs are $13,200 (limit $14,500).\n- **Documents:** I sent the 12 statements and payslips the lender asked for. These are the last 2 statements for each of the four personal accounts and the last 2 payslips for each of you. Nothing else was shared, and the application was not submitted again.\n- **$8,000 deposit condition:** I asked Sam about the 9/3 deposit. I told the lender it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment, not a loan.\n- **W-2 condition:** The lender asked for the 2025 W-2s only after the first documents went in. I sent both W-2s in response to that condition.",
